From f28d6032d1a92ac41650d72822fdd86349d022e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mohammed <91819504+mohammed7s@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 02:40:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] computercontrol: reserve creation without holding the session
 registry lock

Construct, revalidate, mutate authorization and close outside mSessions. Use pending reservations and an authorization generation to reject creations invalidated by concurrent edits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
